                                            such other business, including stockholder proposals, as may properly come before the meeting.</span></td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The meeting will also include a report on our financial results for
fiscal year 2025, an overview of our 2025 Impact&#160;&amp; Sustainability initiatives, and our outlook for the remainder of 2026.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 12pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #3f5765"><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><b>RECORD DATE:</b></span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Only stockholders of record at the close of business on March&#160;31,
2026, will be entitled to receive notice of, and to vote at, the 2026 Annual Meeting. Our total shares outstanding on the Record Date
are 48,611,167.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

