</div><div><a id="a_sp1004"></a></div><p style="font: 12pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #3f5765"><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><b>2025 PERFORMANCE
HIGHLIGHTS</b></span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #3f5765"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
2025 performance is summarized below:</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;" width="100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 14pt">&#8226;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
revenue was $2.14 billion, a decrease of 3.2% over the prior year.</span></td></tr></table><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;" width="100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 14pt">&#8226;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
                                            loss from operations was $117.1 million<sup>1</sup>, or (5.5)% of revenue. Income from operations on a non-GAAP basis<sup>2</sup> was $155.0 million,
                                            or 7.3% of revenue, compared to 6.2% in the prior year.</span></td></tr></table><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;" width="100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 14pt">&#8226;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
                                            net cash provided by/(used in) operating activities was $121.1 million compared to ($58.8)
                                            million in the prior year.</span></td></tr></table><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;" width="100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 14pt">&#8226;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
                                            diluted earnings/(loss) per share was ($3.99)<sup>1</sup> compared to net loss per share
                                            of ($6.74) in the prior year, and $1.10<sup>2</sup> compared to $0.71 in the prior year on
                                            a non-GAAP basis.</span></td></tr></table><div>

