    Technology (Interim Chair)</span></p>
    <p style="font: 8pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#8226;</span>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif">Audit</span></p>
    <p style="font: 8pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#8226;</span>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif">Nominating
