</div><p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-size: 10pt">The table below sets forth the beneficial
ownership of TTEC stock for the following persons and entities as of March&#160;31, 2026:</span></p><div>

