<td style="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"/><td style="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><span style=" font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td><td style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">Each
